# ------------------------------------------ scratch outputs, never quote these
# *_smoke*  : tiny 4,000-row runs used to check code paths
# *_demo*   : illustration runs
# _verify/  : throwaway directory used when re-checking reproducibility
#
# NOTE (2026-10-17): `outputs/logs/` is deliberately NOT excluded any more.
# The per-step level-5 logs (L01-L07) are cited as archived evidence in the
# manuscript (sec. 9; SI S10 and S11), and they are listed in outputs/MD5SUMS.txt.
# Excluding them made the published archive unable to satisfy its own manifest:
# a reader cloning the repo and running `make_md5sums.py --check` would see 28
# listed-but-missing files. The whole directory is ~70 KB, so it ships.
outputs/_verify/
outputs/*_smoke*.png
outputs/*_smoke*.csv
outputs/*_demo*.png
outputs/*_demo*.csv
outputs/*_smoke2*
outputs/*.txt
!outputs/MD5SUMS.txt

# ------------------------------------------- non-delivery, never for reviewers
# Withdrawn CGCNN arm scripts and HTML build intermediates (see 00_投稿必读.md:
# these two directories are excluded from the submission package). Keep them out
# of any commit so `git add .` cannot push them.
_non_delivery_archive/
_build/

# Withdrawn experiments kept only for provenance.
# cgcnn_*          : deep-learning arm withdrawn 2026-10-09 (target variance
#                    differed 7.7x between the two test sets)
# granularity_*   : random-compression granularity alignment, withdrawn
# cgcnn_graphs_*.pt : graph tensors for the same withdrawn arm
outputs/cgcnn_*
outputs/granularity_control.csv
outputs/*.pt

